<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>🎨 Border Overlay System Demo - Wavelength Lore</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: #333;
        }
        
        .demo-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .demo-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .demo-header h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2.5em;
        }
        
        .demo-header p {
            color: #7f8c8d;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .step-section {
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid #3498db;
        }
        
        .step-number {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #3498db;
            color: white;
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }
        
        .demo-product-card {
            background: white;
            border: 3px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 300px;
            vertical-align: top;
            margin-right: 20px;
        }
        
        .demo-product-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff6b6b, #feca57);
            border: 2px solid #333;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .demo-btn {
            background: #28a745;
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid #333;
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .demo-btn:hover {
            background: #218838;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .demo-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        
        .navigation-section {
            background: #e8f4fd;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .nav-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 10px 15px 10px 0;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #007bff;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .nav-link:hover {
            background: #0056b3;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 2px solid #dee2e6;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .highlight-box {
            background: #fff3cd;
            border: 2px solid #ffeaa7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .code-example {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #ecf0f1;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            margin: 15px 0;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="demo-container">
        <div class="demo-header">
            <h1>🎨 Border Overlay System</h1>
            <p>Add professional borders to your merchandise images to create better visual transitions from artwork to fabric</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="navigation-section">
            <h3>📍 Navigate to These Pages:</h3>
            <a href="/admin" class="nav-link">🏠 Admin Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research" class="nav-link">🔬 Vendor Research</a>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research/preview-generator" class="nav-link">🎨 Preview Generator</a>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research/catalog" class="nav-link">📦 Vendor Catalog</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="step-section">
            <h2><span class="step-number">1</span>Generate Some Products First</h2>
            <p>Before you can add borders, you need some product previews. Go to the Preview Generator and create some test products.</p>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research/preview-generator" class="demo-btn">🎨 Generate Products</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="step-section">
            <h2><span class="step-number">2</span>View Your Product Catalog</h2>
            <p>Once you have products, go to the Vendor Catalog to see all your generated merchandise previews.</p>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research/catalog" class="demo-btn">📦 View Catalog</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="step-section">
            <h2><span class="step-number">3</span>Add Borders to Products</h2>
            <p>In the catalog, each product card will have a "🎨 Add Border" button. Click it to open the border selection modal.</p>
            
            <div class="demo-product-card">
                <div class="demo-product-image">
                    Sample Product Image
                </div>
                <div><strong>Product:</strong> T-Shirt Design</div>
                <div><strong>Provider:</strong> Printify</div>
                <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                    <button class="demo-btn" onclick="showBorderDemo()">🎨 Add Border</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="highlight-box">
            <h3>🎯 What Happens When You Click "Add Border":</h3>
            <ol>
                <li><strong>Modal Opens:</strong> Interactive border configuration interface</li>
                <li><strong>Choose Border Type:</strong> Solid, Gradient, Pattern, Wavelength Theme, or Blend</li>
                <li><strong>Customize Settings:</strong> Colors, width, opacity, effects</li>
                <li><strong>Real-time Preview:</strong> See before/after comparison</li>
                <li><strong>Apply Border:</strong> Save the bordered version</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔸</div>
                <h4>Solid Borders</h4>
                <p>Simple colored borders with adjustable width and opacity</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🌈</div>
                <h4>Gradient Borders</h4>
                <p>Linear, radial, or conic gradients with multiple colors</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🎨</div>
                <h4>Pattern Borders</h4>
                <p>Polka dots, stars, stripes, and custom patterns</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h4>Wavelength Themes</h4>
                <p>Game-themed borders featuring Wavelength Lore elements</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🌊</div>
                <h4>Blend Effects</h4>
                <p>Smooth blending for seamless fabric transitions</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h4>Quick Presets</h4>
                <p>One-click application of popular border styles</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="step-section">
            <h2><span class="step-number">4</span>Test the API Directly (Advanced)</h2>
            <p>You can also test the border system using API calls:</p>
            <div class="code-example">
POST /api/merchandise/border-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceImageUrl": "https://your-image-url.com/image.jpg",
  "borderConfig": {
    "type": "solid",
    "color": "#ff0000",
    "width": 15,
    "opacity": 1.0
  }
}
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="navigation-section">
            <h3>🚀 Ready to Get Started?</h3>
            <p>Follow the steps above to experience the complete border overlay system!</p>
            <a href="/admin/vendor-research/preview-generator" class="nav-link">🎨 Start with Preview Generator</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <script>
        function showBorderDemo() {
            alert('🎨 In the real catalog, this would open the Border Selection Modal!\n\n' +
                  'The modal includes:\n' +
                  '• Real-time preview\n' +
                  '• 5 border types to choose from\n' +
                  '• Color pickers and sliders\n' +
                  '• Quick preset buttons\n' +
                  '• Before/after comparison\n\n' +
                  'Go to the Vendor Catalog to see it in action!');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>